@startuml
title Canh bao nguoi than khi lan uong chua duoc xac nhan
autonumber
participant "node-cron scheduler" as Cron
participant "notificationService" as Service
database "MongoDB" as DB
participant "Firebase Admin / FCM" as FCM
participant "Service Worker" as SW
actor "Nguoi than" as Relative
Cron -> Service : Moi phut quet lan uong qua nguong
Service -> DB : Tim dose chua xac nhan va qua han cuoi
DB --> Service : Dose + owner + snoozed_until
Service -> DB : Tim connection active voi relative_alerts=true
DB --> Service : Ket noi va thiet bi active
Service -> DB : Kiem tra notification_logs chong trung
alt Da gui hoac dose da ket thuc
  Service -> Service : Bo qua
else Canh bao can gui
  Service -> FCM : Gui data-only push den token nguoi than
  alt FCM gui thanh cong
    FCM --> Service : Message ID
    Service -> DB : Ghi notification log sent
    FCM -> SW : Push event
    SW -> Relative : Hien thi thong bao
  else FCM loi
    FCM --> Service : Loi
    Service -> DB : Ghi log that bai / danh dau token neu het han
  end
end
note over Cron,Relative
Nguong mac dinh 15 phut sau gio den han cuoi
(snoozed_until neu da nhac lai).
Moi dose chi gui mot canh bao.
end note
@enduml
